==Battleground==
*1 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you have obtained [[Courier Cat]] by this point, you can witness his true power as you stack him and watch him utterly destroy Casaurian Ahirujo. The Aku Gories are annoying, but they spawn after a long time, are sparse, and are quickly shredded by Area Attackers like [[Paris Cat]] or [[Castaway Cat]].

